---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import timeline from '../data/timeline.json';
const ev = [...timeline.concept_events].reverse();
---
<Base title="Changelog">
  <header class="space-y-2"><p class="mono-label">Changelog</p><h1 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-tight">Dated, with confidence</h1>
    <p class="text-brand-secondary">H = git or in-document date · M = file or zip time · L = inferred. Asia/Colombo.</p></header>
  <ol class="space-y-3">
    <li class="panel"><p class="mono-label">2026-11-17 · data</p><p class="font-bold">Desk verification round.</p><p class="text-sm">Public sources only. One more duplicate folded (LK-WO-0332 → 0061). 11 unverified candidate rows added for Badulla, Nuwara Eliya, Kilinochchi, Mullaitivu, Mannar and Vavuniya. Each approximate point now shows a location check (median error 1.16 km on 48 independent checks); proposed corrections are not applied. Not deployed.</p></li>
    <li class="panel"><p class="mono-label">2026-11-17 · data</p><p class="font-bold">Map uses the merged directory (merge v2).</p><p class="text-sm">8 duplicate ids folded into canonical rows, 65 approximate coordinates written back into the directory, 6 proposed rows (unverified), evidence and domain tags shown per point. Not deployed.</p></li>
    <li class="panel"><p class="mono-label">2026-11-16 · site</p><p class="font-bold">Atlas prototype: site/ + docs/visuals/ opened as a PR to Intuitui-Labs/anavaratha. Not deployed.</p><p class="text-sm">Map coverage up (geocoded from own addresses, rest listed with reasons); zoom-aware graph labels; undated lane; keyword-inferred links marked.</p></li>
    {ev.map((e) => <li class="panel"><p class="mono-label">{e.date} · {e.type} · {e.confidence}</p><p class="font-bold">{e.title}</p><p class="text-sm">{e.effect}</p></li>)}
  </ol>
  <p class="src">anavaratha-legacy/CHRONOLOGY.md §A</p>
</Base>
